 are in planting zone 6b, I like to plan as if we are in zone 5. We have a lot of very harsh cold wind that can bring a scalding freeze to many plants that should be safe in zone 6b. I waited patiently this year and didn't get my tomato plants until after Mother's day because we had an exceptionally long and cool winter. It really did freeze the night before Mother's day.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7g3j7","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dnl8e","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f27j6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6ugrr","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"1uok1","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_1855b10c0c1842ffb56028fd2ee0ab51~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Columbine"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_1532069f921f479eac5f46f5f21dbcf8~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Pumpkins"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_0f060253417544f492d91e08901b3a50~mv2_d_3024_4032_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":3024,"height":4032}},"title":"Cucumbers"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_1bc670042f3d4089bd7a21bb0ad59032~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Pumpkins"}],"options":{"layout":{"type":"GRID","horizontalScroll":false,"orientation":"ROWS","numberOfColumns":2},"item":{"targetSize":300,"ratio":1,"crop":"FILL","spacing":10},"thumbnails":{"placement":"BOTTOM","spacing":0}}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cigc9","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Now I have several volunteer plants growing up out of the ground and I'm so happy to see some of my reseeders coming to life. Even the pumpkin seeds I saved from last years halloween pumpkins and planted recently have sprouted strongly. Now if I just new which ones I planted in which group! I was carefully keeping the two varieties separated as I dried and stored them but I didn't mark them when I planted them, oops! One variety is a ghost white pumpkin and the other is a warty pumpkin. They aren't great for eating but they are so much fun! I can't wait to see how this garden grows.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"daj1m","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7h0vo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3koeh","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bhnbm","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5bbav","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"b7020","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData